{"url": "https://mdkgcollege.edu.in/a-state-level-lecture-on-hybrid-mode-was-organised-by-neigs-in-collaboration-with-the-department-of-geography-mdkg-college-on-15-09-26/", "retrieved": "2026-10-02", "status": "ok", "final_url": "https://mdkgcollege.edu.in/a-state-level-lecture-on-hybrid-mode-was-organised-by-neigs-in-collaboration-with-the-department-of-geography-mdkg-college-on-15-09-26/", "text": "A State Level Lecture on Hybrid mode was organised by NEIGS in collaboration with the Department of Geography, MDKG College on 15/09/26. - MDKG\nSkip to content\nNew Admission 2026-27\nAdmission Link\nMA Admission Link 2026-27\nSSR AFTER DVV (NEW)\nIQAC\nNIRF\nNAAC\nAISHE\nProspectus\nAlumni\nPublications\nA+\nA\nA-\nToggle Navigation\nHome\nAbouts\nAbout MDKG College\nVision and Mission\nMotto\nEmblem\nCollege Anthem\nFormer Principals\nFormer GB President\nAdministration\nGoverning Body\nAdministrative Office\nPrincipal\nVice-Principal\nOffice Staff\nPolicy Documents\nAcademic Calender\nUndertaking\nCode of Conduct\nAcademic\nAdmission\nProspectus\nProcedure\nSeat Capacity\nEligibility\nFee Structure\nFee Waiver OM\nFee Structure for UG Courses\nProgrammes\nB.A.\nB.Sc.\nM.A. in Assamese\nOthers\nAdd On\nCurriculum  Delivery\nProgramme and Course Outcome\nMentor Mentee System\nAcademic Calender\nRoutine\nSyllabus\nAssessment of PO & CO\nExamination\nEamination Notice\nRules and Regulations\nInternal Assessment\nResults\nPublications\nJournal\nBooks\nCollege Magazine\nDepartment Magazine\nNewsletter\nResearch & Development\nDivision\nCells\nClubs\nNSS\nNCC\nICC\nFacilities\nLibrary\nICT Facilities\nInfrastructure\nSports\nSummary\nStudent Corner\nCareer & Placement\nStudent Union\nPlacement Record\nAnti Ragging\nAchievement\nStudent Election\nDepartments\nOld Website\nSearch\nA State Level Lecture on Hybrid mode was organised by NEIGS in collaboration with the Department of Geography, MDKG College on 15/09/26.\nA State Level Lecture on Hybrid mode was organised by NEIGS in collaboration with the Department of Geography, MDKG College on 15/09/26.\nA State Level Lecture on Hybrid mode was organised by NEIGS in collaboration with the Department of Geography, MDKG College on 15/09/26. Addressing the audience, our respected Resource Person, Dr. B.K. Kar, Professor and former Head of Department of Geography, Gauhati University spoke about “Quantification in Geography: Its relevance and applications”. Prof. B.K. Kar’s enlightening lecture was mainly targeted towards the students and they have been greatly benefited by it.\nDr. A.K. Bharali, Principal of the college in his welcome address spoke about the significance of quantification. Dr. N. Deka, Associate Prof., Dept. of Geography, Gauhati University and General Secretary of NEIGS spoke about the objectives of NEIGS and organising such programs.\nThe program was attended by around 120 students of the department, and sufficient number of students and faculty members from DHSK College, Barama College, Goalpara College, Sivsagar Girls’ College, students and research scholars of Gauhati University. Dr. A. Machey (Co-ordinator, IQACMDKGC) and Dr. R. Majumder, HoD of Philosophy of the college attended the lecture.\nI, on behalf of the Department thank everyone for their heartfelt help and support .\nDr. M. Bagchi\nAssoc Professor & Head\nDept of Geography\nMDKG College\nadmin\n2026-09-24T16:39:52+05:30\nMDKG College\nK.C. Gogoi Road, Khalihamari, Dibrugarh\n6026178808\n[email protected]\nVisitors since 17/02/2025\n0\n7\n5\n6\n5\n4\nUsers Today : 162\nTotal Users : 75654\nTotal views : 186640\nCOMMITTEES\nDISCIPLINE, ANTI-RAGGING CELL\nEQUAL OPPORTUNITY CELL\nCOUNSELLING CELL\nGRIEVANCE REDRESSAL COMMITTEE\nRECENT POSTS\nadmin\n2026-09-24T16:42:30+05:30\nCounselling sessions from 8th September 2026\nadmin\n2026-09-24T16:39:52+05:30\nA State Level Lecture on Hybrid mode was organised by NEIGS in collaboration with the Department of Geography, MDKG College on 15/09/26.\nadmin\n2026-09-24T16:12:45+05:30\nSeva Sankalp Abhiyan – Institutional Level Speech Competition\nadmin\n2026-09-23T16:47:57+05:30\nPermission to offer Honours with Research in the Depafiments of Assamese and English under FYUGP.\nUSEFUL LINKS\nUGC\nRUSA, ASSAM\nNIRF\nAISHE\nAICTE\nNAAC\nDHE, ASSAM\nDIBRUGARH UNIVERSITY\n© Copyright 2026, Manohari Devi Kanoi Girls' College, Dibrugarh\nPowered By:\nKB\nQUBE\nPage load link\nGo to Top", "links": [{"label": "Skip to content", "url": "https://mdkgcollege.edu.in/a-state-level-lecture-on-hybrid-mode-was-organised-by-neigs-in-collaboration-with-the-department-of-geography-mdkg-college-on-15-09-26/#content"}, {"label": "New Admission 2026-27", "url": "https://mdkgcollege.edu.in/new-admission/"}, {"label": "Admission Link", "url": "https://assamadmission.samarth.ac.in/"}, {"label": "MA Admission Link 2026-27", "url": "https://forms.gle/PSQocbu5xVUwprYR9"}, {"label": "SSR AFTER DVV (NEW)", "url": "https://mdkgcollege.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/SSR.pdf"}, {"label": "IQAC", "url": "https://mdkgcollege.edu.in/iqac/"}, {"label": "NIRF", "url": "https://mdkgcollege.edu.in/nirf/"}, {"label": "NAAC", "url": "https://mdkgcollege.edu.in/naac-report/"}, {"label": "AISHE", "url": "https://mdkgcollege.edu.in/aishe/"}, {"label": "Prospectus", "url": "https://mdkgcollege.edu.in/prospectus/"}, {"label": "Alumni", "url": "https://mdkgcollege.edu.in/alumni/"}, {"label": "Publications", "url": "https://mdkgcollege.edu.in/publications-2/"}, {"label": "", "url": "https://mdkgcollege.edu.in/"}, {"label": "", "url": "https://mdkgcollege.edu.in/"}, {"label": "Home", "url": "https://mdkgcollege.edu.in/"}, {"label": "Abouts", "url": "https://mdkgcollege.edu.in/a-state-level-lecture-on-hybrid-mode-was-organised-by-neigs-in-collaboration-with-the-department-of-geography-mdkg-college-on-15-09-26/"}, {"label": "About MDKG College", "url": "https://mdkgcollege.edu.in/about-us/"}, {"label": "Vision and Mission", "url": "https://mdkgcollege.edu.in/vision-and-mission-of-m-d-